;#####################################################################;
;## PLUGIN for itms_dismantle.script - Items refunct mod, Plaargath ##;
;#####################################################################;

; This plugin contains lists of items that are viable tools and targets for dismantle feature and puts them into categories used by the script. New usable items added to the game should be added here. For further settings like probabs, content, tool behaviour and such, appropriate sections in dismantle_confgis.ltx should be created.
; Creating a new category needs creating a new pipeline inside the script. Some minor alterations to the script content execution engine might be needed when adding new items to the game. Adding a new dismantling tool will require more scripting.
; Lists at the end of this file (debug lists) serve as feed for debug helper functions in pla.script. Update them on adding any kind of weapon addon to the game.

